  "description": "CAFWUG crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group P 43 21 2. Reported CIF formula moiety: C108 H132 B6 O7 Sm4,C6 H14. From the CIF bond table, Sm01 (Sm) has 4 O neighbors; Sm02 (Sm) has 4 O neighbors; Sm3 (Sm) has 4 O neighbors; Sm4 (Sm) has 4 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.765-3.805 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 98.64-110.47°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula Sm4(μ-OBMes2)6(μ4-O).",
